WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.076
An if inside a function lets the function choose its answer.

2
00:00:05.127 --> 00:00:08.627
Sizes over fifty get red. The rest get blue.

3
00:00:09.452 --> 00:00:13.102
The loop asks the function about every size in the list.

4
00:00:16.522 --> 00:00:21.522
A small blue dot, then a big red one. The function decided each time.
